        "content": "<p>pujitha24 opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14881\">PR #14881</a> from <code>pujitha24:auto/issue-14571</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Discussed in issue #14571.</p>\n<p>This forwards debug tags on a <code>try_call</code> during Cranelift lowering. Previously they were dropped because <code>try_call</code> goes through the branch-lowering path, which only copied stack maps. With inlining this loses breakpoint patch records and frame-table entries for inlined callees.</p>\n<p>Validation: a new x64 filetest fails before and passes after; the Cranelift isa/runtests filetests and cranelift-codegen unit tests pass. I could not run <code>tests/all/debug.rs</code> locally (wasm32-unknown-unknown target missing), so the Wasmtime-level behavior is untested here.</p>\n<p>Per the AI tool use policy: this change was prepared with AI assistance.</p>\n<p>This PR was written in part with the assistance of generative AI.</p>\n<p>Fixes #14571</p>\n</blockquote>",
